  "body": "## Highlights\n\n- **Both crosshair lines are back.** The chart under the pointer shows the horizontal line and its price again, and resting charts such as Inventories now follow the pointer. (#2010)\n- **Reconnect a broker from the portfolio.** An offline broker's positions say when they last synced and why, and `b` reconnects it. (#2011)\n- **Portfolios in other currencies.** `PORT` Risk, Factors, Correlation and Stress work for an account that is not in USD, and a position bought in another currency takes a purchase date or cost FX rate, so P&L shows the currency move. (#2004, #2007)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- `EXEC` shows each executive's total pay and `MOST` lists pre-market and after-hours movers on every plan. (#2015)\n- `PORT` and `MARS` add a quality factor (QUAL - SPY), and `catalog style` finds it. (#2006)\n- Pasted ticker lists read every cell and name the ones that need a choice. (#2005)\n- Turkish CPI in `econ --country TR` and as a series. (#2009)\n- Quick Notes no longer saves a new index over one it could not read, and `notes export` writes your Cloud notes and says what it skipped. (#1998, #1999)\n- The Team pane says when invitations fail to load instead of showing none. (#2000)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.18.0...v0.18.1)\n"
